### Criar agendamento
POST http://localhost:8080/agendamentos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "servico": "Corte + Barba",
  "profissional": "Carlos",
  "dataHoraAgendamento": "2030-06-15T14:30:00",
  "cliente": "Guilherme Rodrigues",
  "telefoneCliente": "11999999999"
}

### Mesmo profissional e horário -> 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/agendamentos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "servico": "Corte",
  "profissional": "Carlos",
  "dataHoraAgendamento": "2030-06-15T14:30:00",
  "cliente": "Outro Cliente"
}

### Agenda do dia
GET http://localhost:8080/agendamentos?data=2030-06-15

### Remarcar
PUT http://localhost:8080/agendamentos?cliente=Guilherme Rodrigues&dataHoraAgendamento=2030-06-15T14:30:00
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "servico": "Corte + Barba",
  "profissional": "Carlos",
  "dataHoraAgendamento": "2030-06-15T16:00:00",
  "cliente": "Guilherme Rodrigues",
  "telefoneCliente": "11999999999"
}

### Cancelar
DELETE http://localhost:8080/agendamentos?cliente=Guilherme Rodrigues&dataHoraAgendamento=2030-06-15T16:00:00
